  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.5.0 preserves package, class, method and signature ownership of Cobertura branches through parsing and report merging.\nDistinct owners on the same source line contribute all their outcomes; class summaries remain deduplicated. Fixes a real false pass where 4/6 branches were reported as 3/4.\nAdds scoped branch metadata for library consumers while preserving CLI, JSON and exit contracts. The full MSTest suite retains the unchanged measurement scope and 100% line and branch gates.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.5.0.md",
